pro_course_detail.description:
This course is for those who are interested in Asian business culture and want to do business in China market. The class focuses on essential language used in the business world, it consists of basic business vocabulary , sentence and conversation.
Through this course, you will learn:
1. How to communicate with your partners or clients smoothy;
2. To understand Chinese business culture fully;
3. To use Chinese business language correctly;
4. To help you increase your business influence and career growth.

This is an academic course. The course is based on the linked language skills of listening, reading, speaking and writing, and these are built on as learners progress through their studies. Teacher will prepare your personal lessons according to your level and goals, she may use double or more time for preparing a lesson. 
Student who is learning Mandarin Chinese as a foreign language or second language or first language at school, and want to pass the exam and get high scores , welcome to join this class!

Through this course, you will :

1.Grasp IGCSE/A'Level/IB /AP exam required vocabulary, grammar,phrases and sentences;
2.Effectively read and understand Chinese articles & news  without dictionary well;
3.Improve your speaking skills and talk to Chinese friends smoothly with confidence;
4. Be able to do a perfect presentation and use idioms and old sayings correctly;
4.Understand Chinese culture and etiquette, and can communicate with others fluently;
5. Have a good writing skill and express yourself well by Chinese language;
6.  Get high scores and achieve your Chinese exam goals.

❤️TIPS:
Different level, different price. 
For example, IB year11 is different  from year12. Writing class is different from the normal class. 

If you are my old student and buy more than 20 lessons for a package each time, please let me know before you order, you can get a special offer .
